Title: freecam

Summary: Free orbit camera for Pokemon Alpha Sapphire

Description: |
  An orbit camera for the overworld of Pokemon Alpha Sapphire v1.4.
  The camera follows the player, but only the right stick turns it.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
